# FLINTHOLD: each fire pit beside a hunter adds half its damage again (a
# thrower's bone: 10, then 15 by one pit, 20 by two).
game flinthold
wait 5
cheat stage 1
cheat hold
cheat unit thrower 3 4
cheat foe nipper 0 48
wait 30
expect foe0_hp == 400
cheat killall
cheat fire 4 4
cheat foe nipper 0 48
wait 45
expect foe0_hp == 350
cheat killall
cheat fire 3 5
cheat foe nipper 0 48
wait 45
expect foe0_hp == 300
